  "body": "Come home to your new home that boasts space for the family, a garage for your toys and space to park the car. Kamata Rise in Ara Hills, Wainui offers a floor plan to suit your checklist.  \r\n\r\n*  Only 3 minutes to Orewa town centre \r\n*  5 minutes to Orewa Beach \r\n*  Approximately 35 minutes to Auckland CBD (via SH1) \r\n*  Close to shops, supermarkets, cafes & local markets \r\n*  In zone for quality local schools incl. Orewa Primary & Orewa College \r\n\r\nThese homes solve your 3 bedroom search worries by offering 132 sqm of floor space, 2 shared bathrooms along with a garage and carpark - why compromise on lifestyle and convenience when you can have it all.\r\n\r\nBuilt by Ceta Homes, this thoughtfully designed home offers the perfect balance of modern style and everyday functionality. The kitchen features a white engineered stone benchtop, complemented by a stylish mix of white and wood grain cabinetry, tiled splashbacks, and soft-close drawers. Fisher & Paykel appliances - including a multifunction oven, ceramic cooktop plus more - makes cooking a pleasure. \r\n\r\nIn the bathroom, you'll find a contemporary wall-hung vanity with an integrated basin and chrome tapware, framed by tile splashbacks and easy-clean finishes. The acrylic shower includes a sliding shower system behind safety glass, while a wall-mounted toilet with integrated cistern, a mirror cabinet, and a heated towel rail complete the space.  \r\n\r\nOutside, you'll enjoy a private, fully fenced outdoor area with professional landscaping, a dedicated mailbox, and a foldable clothesline. The exterior combines brick veneer, vertical board or aluminium cladding, a Coloursteel roof, double-glazed joinery, complemented by an aluminium entry door with keyless electronic access. With provisions in place for EV charging (charger unit to be supplied and installed by the owner). \r\n\r\nEvery detail has been considered to deliver a modern, low-maintenance lifestyle from the day you move in. Estimated Completion due Q1 2027.\r\n\r\n*Materials subject to change while to something to a similar product.",
